WEBVTT

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.140
Next...

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.890
Aoi! Serious fighting like this will
leave the Sisters beyond recovery!

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:29.020
Did Father really order this?

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:34.990
Yes. He told me to choose one
person to help seize the Witchblade.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:41.620
But I thought he wasn't interested
in the Witchblade anymore?

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.160
The circumstances have changed.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.800
It's only a rumor, but I've heard
that Father has actually died...

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:58.260
...and the execs are covering it up
Nonsense. He sent me here himself.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:04.390
You... What is your name?!

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:07.270
Asagi.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.110
Okay, Asagi-san! Please come with me!

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.690
What for?

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.950
As the one chosen, you will help
obtain that which must be obtained!

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
How simple it all is.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.120
This enormous organization, the budget...

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.750
I can do as I please with all of it...

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:37.670
And I used to make such a
fuss over single teddy bears...

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.550
Now, I just need that...

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.480
...and I'll...

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.400
I have no need for you now.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.210
"Inform"

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.760
I'll ask one more time...

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.310
Is there no way at all to take that off?

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.850
Nope.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.730
I tried to struggle in vain,

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:58.190
but all I learned was
that it'll never come off.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.820
There's no reason for you
to be depressed! It's all right!

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:09.030
What's all right?!
The fact that you can't take it off...

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.620
It means...

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.330
It means that...

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.130
It's all right now.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.460
I've accepted it.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:26.930
It's just... what am I going to tell Riko?

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:32.430
I'm not worried about how she'll get by;
I've saved up lots of money.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.810
Plus, she has a father.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.770
Father?

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.230
Yeah. Takayama.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:42.070
Hold on, just 'cause you two are an item...

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.740
...doesn't mean he can take care of a kid!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:48.700
No, it's not like that. He's her real father.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.740
Takayama was Riko's father.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.540
Are you serious?!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.910
Isn't it a relief, though?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:59.330
But that won't make it any
better for Rihoko, you know!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.590
Yeah...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:07.720
She is... going to lose her mother.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.970
It's going to break her heart.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.970
Mom...

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:21.270
But I don't want her to stay heartbroken.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.190
I want her to be able to smile
again as soon as possible!

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:28.530
Do you suppose that's
what I can do for her now?!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.120
Tell me! What should I say to her?!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:38.830
H-How should I know?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:43.130
Yeah, I guess it is tough...

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.380
Truly...

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.270
Here you go. Have seconds...

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.780
Riko...

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.740
Damn it!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.210
Can't we do anything?!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.540
Ota!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.640
It worked! Installing this antibody program...

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:36.930
...can remove the Witchblade's
interference and let us control them!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:41.600
Good! Split up and get to work!
I'll give you the access codes now!

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.870
"What is Life?"

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:16.640
Three?! You have only three IU-Weapons?!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.020
That's right. They should be enough.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.600
We need five to be extra sure!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:26.480
Are you insane? They're going to
fight the Witchblade, you know!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:29.530
Five?! Are you trying to destroy the city?!

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:34.820
At any rate, preparations are complete.
The rest is up to you.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.160
I do hope you've laid the groundwork!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.790
Don't underestimate me.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.500
Douji is nothing like your
pathetic little organization!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:43.920
Oh, really?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.540
And who was it who begged that
pathetic little organization...

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.630
...to sell information again?

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:52.840
You're the one who came to me for money!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:57.680
Well, no matter. I look forward
to having the Witchblade.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.770
What a cowardly man.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.690
Once I have the Witchblade,
it's time to cut him off.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:09.520
It's about time to give her the boot, too.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:14.740
Sir, the government has approved
the X-Con Removal Plan.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.280
Oh?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:20.660
The danger zones we've specified
are now under strict curfew,

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.790
and once we have an exact location,
the police and fire departments...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.790
...will help evacuate citizens in the area.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.790
Shall I have the lab mobilize the I-Weapons?

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:32.920
No, it has already been taken care of.

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:34.800
It has?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.470
Oh, speaking of the lab,

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.720
they sent a request to halt
the shipment to Baradhi.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:47.020
There were only a few malfunctions
with the I-Weapons in storage.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:49.690
Halting the shipment would be excessive.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.860
I believe the ship has
already left port, anyway.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.280
Yes, two days ago.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.780
There is no problem with it.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:01.790
More important is the Witchblade.
We cannot fail this time.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:08.830
Morning!

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:15.050
What's going on, Mom?
You never get up before I wake you up...

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.880
It's just such a nice day today!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.800
Hey, what do you say we go hiking?

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.390
Hiking?

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.770
See? I even made you a lunch!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:29.150
You... made this?!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:34.320
That's right! It's not very cool,
but I'm confident it's good!

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.940
Wow!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.280
Morning!
Morning!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.410
Oh, are you two going somewhere?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:46.830
Yeah! Mom and I are going
hiking at Sakuragaoka Park!

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:48.040
Bye!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.170
Come on, Mom!
Coming!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.140
Are those two going somewhere?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:02.760
Hiking at Sakuragaoka Park.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.480
Did you not sleep? You don't look so good.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:13.060
Tell me, Mariko-san. Do you believe in God?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.440
Huh?

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:18.860
I was just thinking about praying
to him if he really does exist.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.030
Wha ?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.280
Who knows.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:29.330
If he does exist, he's probably
been long buried under all that rubble.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.210
Yeah...

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:40.930
Maria-sama, I've selected a Sister.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.220
Asagi-san, please say hello.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.940
Good work, Aoi. Give her a Cloneblade.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:58.650
Yes! This way, Asagi-san!

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:06.950
I heard that the chosen person
is helping get what needs to be got.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.870
Yes, that's correct.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.620
What is it?

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:12.920
Power.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.920
Power, huh?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.920
You don't want it?

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.800
Dunno.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:28.260
Asagi-san, please refrain from
saying anything rude to Maria-sama!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.100
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.600
But she's just pretending to be an adult.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:33.730
Watch your mouth!

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:37.730
She's so a kid inside...

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.870
It's so pretty!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.120
Mom! Look! Look!

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.120
These cosmos flowers are so pretty!

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:57.920
Please let me be able to tell her...

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.890
I humbly accept this!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:15.440
It's delicious! You used just
the right amount of salt, Mom!

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:19.690
See? Even I can do stuff, too!

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:24.740
But this tamagoyaki might
have a little too much sugar...

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.780
Eh? You think?

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:45.550
Mom!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:51.930
Isn't this such a pretty park?

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:56.730
Yeah. I'm sure Heaven
is as pretty as this, too.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.690
Eh?

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:05.360
You know, Riko. When people die,
their spirits go to Heaven.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:09.780
But, they're not sad or anything! They, uhh...

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.620
Even if their spirits are far away,

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:20.340
Heaven is called a far-but-near place,
and it's in the sky...

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.090
Eh? What are you talking about, Mom?

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:26.720
Oh, I mean,

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.930
uhh... Huh?

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:35.060
Say, never mind Heaven;
let's build our house in a place like this!

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:39.230
A two-story house,
with a garden for lots of flowers!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.400
Oh, and I'd like a doggy, too!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.280
Maybe those blueprints were a little small!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:51.700
Would you prefer an even bigger house, Mom?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.290
Rihoko...

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:07.840
That house... I can't...

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.300
Eh?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.720
What is it, Mom?

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.810
Listen, Riko.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.480
Very soon, I don't think...

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.280
...you'll be able to see me anymore.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.360
Eh?

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.530
Don't worry.

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:31.320
You just won't be able to see me.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.740
I won't leave you.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.740
I'd never leave you all alone, Riko.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:42.460
I'll be by your side, just like I always have.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.050
You'll never be all alone.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.840
Don't forget that.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:03.310
We interrupt with this urgent news report.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.860
It was just announced that
not all weapons were recovered...

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.740
...after Douji Industries'
weapon leakage incident.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.700
No way! Is this for real?!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:16.120
...approval to conduct retrieval
operations using its own weapons.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:20.290
What's goin' on? I thought all
the X-Cons were recovered?

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.540
...but evacuation orders may be given,

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:27.210
so please pay attention to
the news and police reports.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:29.090
That includes us!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.670
But what about Masane-san and

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:33.220
Oh, that's right! They're in danger!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.930
Sakuragaoka Park, right? I'm on my

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.690
Also, images of the unrecovered
"X-Con" weapon have been released.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.020
What is that?!

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:48.780
Yikes! Looks like a woman,
but I'll pass on her!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:49.860
So scary!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.990
So that's the deal, huh?!

00:15:55.160 --> 00:16:00.370
This is the Metro Police.
This area is under curfew.

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:03.410
Please evacuate to
a safe location immediately.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.770
I'll be all right, Riko. You run on home.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.100
Mom!

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.060
Wait!

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.190
Tozawa!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.900
There's no need to take each and every one on!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:32.490
Run. Take Rihoko and run!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.740
Masamune!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.990
I'm not fighting against my will!

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.660
There's a part of me that
can't resist the desire to fight!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:50.340
As long as I have this on,
it'll be the same wherever I go.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:51.750
I'm sure I'll keep on fighting.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.680
Take her... back home!

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:06.850
Mom...

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:09.400
Rihoko...

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.150
Mom said I'm not going
to be able to see her soon...

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.870
Say, Tozawa-Chan...

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.670
That means...

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.880
she's going to die, doesn't it?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:36.920
Rihoko...

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.400
Mom!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.080
Sir! This is it! It's just like before!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.710
Don't tell me Masane is...

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.340
Sir! Wadou's been granted
permission to mobilize I-Weapons...

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.430
...under the pretext of removing an X-Con!

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.890
Naturally, I think he's after the Witchblade!

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:24.390
Sir! We're never going to make it in time!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.890
Make it happen! Don't let them into the city!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:27.930
Yes, sir!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:33.690
Masane! If you keep fighting
this frequently, you'll be

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:36.940
Suppress your power! Even just a little bit!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:42.450
The power inside me is
getting bigger and bigger...

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.030
So much it could even tear my body apart!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.920
Incredible... Her power
has increased even more!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.840
Just what is happening inside her?!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:02.640
I must research it! I'll never see
anything as incredible as this again!

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:10.230
What... is this?!

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.730
Again?!

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.450
What happened?!
Get him to the infirmary!

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:27.740
Don't stop! Keep working!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.460
Sir! Those are the only ones left!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.670
It's almost like they're
being called out by something!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:44.050
Ota! Attack them using a repaired I-Weapon!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.970
Eh?! In here?!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:48.260
It's better than letting them get out! Quickly!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.930
Yes, sir! Osada! Oda!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.020
Firing!
Get down!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:11.870
Damn! Are they at war or something?!

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:15.120
Whoa, now. Don't tell me...

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.750
How can this be?!

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:22.260
We've gone to such lengths,
and still can't capture the Witchblade...

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:25.130
This is atrocious! Absolutely atrocious!

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.260
Indeed.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:30.260
That reminds me,
I wonder if the lab is all right,

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:31.770
what with the I-Weapon malfunctions.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:37.020
Who gives a damn about that?!
What's going to happen to me?

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:38.900
It might be too late for you.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:13.020
"Roger that. We are headed back.
Could you have a tugboat ready?"

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.530
I have to go back...

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.540
...to my home...

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:37.750
Riko...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:14.100
Mom, the rice balls were delicious!

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:17.060
The tamagoyaki was a little sweet, but good!

00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:22.850
Our picnic at the park was really fun!
The flowers were so pretty!

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:28.320
But the picnic is over now.
Let's go home and eat.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:30.530
I'll make tons of yummy food!

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:36.700
And then we can go to the bathhouse,
talk lots, and then go to bed.

00:23:36.790 --> 00:23:40.750
So let's go home, Mom. Okay?
